      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'FidgetFlow contains bright colors, animated patterns, flashing effects,
    rapid movement, and high-contrast visuals.

    These visual effects may cause
    discomfort or trigger seizures in individuals with photosensitive epilepsy or
    other visual sensitivities.

    If you have a history of photosensitive epilepsy,
    seizures, migraines triggered by visual stimuli, dizziness, or sensitivity to
    flashing lights, please use caution while using this app.

    If you experience
    discomfort at any time, stop using the app immediately.

    By continuing, you
    acknowledge that you understand these risks.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
